What is Kubernetes / K8s? ☸️

Kubernetes is a system used to manage many containers automatically.

Suppose you have only one application:

User
 ↓
One Container
 ↓
College AI Assistant

Docker or Cloud Run can be enough.

======

But imagine your application becomes very large:

100,000 Users
      ↓
Many Containers Needed

You may have:

Container 1 🤖
Container 2 🤖
Container 3 🤖
Container 4 🤖
Container 5 🤖
...
Container 100 🤖

Managing them manually would be difficult.

======

This is where Kubernetes helps.

                Kubernetes ☸️
                      │
        ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
        ↓             ↓             ↓
   Container 1   Container 2   Container 3
        ↓             ↓             ↓
   Your App      Your App      Your App

=====

Kubernetes can help manage:

📈 Scaling containers
🔄 Restarting failed containers
⚖️ Load balancing
🚀 Deploying new versions
🔁 Rolling updates
🩺 Health checking

=========

